{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "atende-facil-api-v1",
    "name": "Atende Fácil API",
    "description": "Coleção completa da API HTTP (Elysia). Base local: `http://localhost:3000`.\n\nDesenvolvimento local: `docs/guides/desenvolvimento-local.md`\n\n**Ordem recomendada:** pasta `01 - Auth (público)` → `02 - Auth (JWT)` → demais.\n\nVariáveis preenchidas automaticamente após Register Tenant, Login e Create Flow.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "webUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5173" },
    { "key": "tenantSlug", "value": "demo-atende" },
    { "key": "adminEmail", "value": "admin@demo.com" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "Test1234!" },
    { "key": "adminDisplayName", "value": "Admin Demo" },
    { "key": "tenantName", "value": "Demo Atende" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "tenantId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "flowId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "conversationId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "scheduleId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": "Liveness check. Sem autenticação."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 - Auth (público)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/register-tenant",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.tenant?.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('tenantId', json.tenant.id);",
                  "  if (json.tenant?.slug) pm.collectionVariables.set('tenantSlug', json.tenant.slug);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tenantName\": \"{{tenantName}}\",\n  \"tenantSlug\": \"{{tenantSlug}}\",\n  \"adminDisplayName\": \"{{adminDisplayName}}\",\n  \"adminEmail\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"adminPassword\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register-tenant",
            "description": "Cria tenant + usuário admin (role admin). Retorna 201.\n\n**Rate limit:** 3 req/min por IP.\n\nCampos obrigatórios: tenantName, tenantSlug, adminDisplayName, adminEmail, adminPassword."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "  if (json.claims?.tenantId) pm.collectionVariables.set('tenantId', json.claims.tenantId);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\",\n  \"tenantSlug\": \"{{tenantSlug}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "description": "Autentica e retorna JWT Bearer.\n\n**MULTI_TENANT=true:** tenantSlug obrigatório.\n\n**Rate limit:** 5 req/min por IP.\n\nResposta: accessToken, tokenType, claims, user."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Auth (JWT)",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /auth/me",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
            "description": "Perfil do usuário autenticado + memberships."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/users (criar agent)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"displayName\": \"Agente Demo\",\n  \"email\": \"agent@demo.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Test1234!\",\n  \"role\": \"agent\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/users",
            "description": "Cria usuário no tenant do token. **Somente admin.**\n\nRoles: admin | manager | agent.\n\ntenantId no body é ignorado (vem do JWT)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/users (criar manager)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"displayName\": \"Manager Demo\",\n  \"email\": \"manager@demo.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Test1234!\",\n  \"role\": \"manager\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/users",
            "description": "Cria manager. **Somente admin.**"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - Tenants",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /tenants/me/timezone",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/tenants/me/timezone",
            "description": "Timezone IANA do tenant autenticado."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH /tenants/me/timezone",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"timezone\": \"America/Sao_Paulo\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/tenants/me/timezone",
            "description": "Atualiza timezone. **admin ou manager.**"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 - Flows",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /flows",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('flowId', json.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Fluxo de boas-vindas\",\n  \"description\": \"Fluxo inicial para testes locais\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/flows",
            "description": "Cria flow em status draft. Salva flowId na variável."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /flows",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/flows?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["flows"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "status", "value": "draft", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista flows paginados. Query opcional: status (draft|published|active|archived)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /flows/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/flows/{{flowId}}",
            "description": "Detalhe do flow."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /flows/:id (definition)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"definition\": {\n    \"startNodeId\": \"welcome\",\n    \"nodes\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"welcome\",\n        \"type\": \"message\",\n        \"text\": \"[ATENDE] Ola! Bem-vindo.\",\n        \"nextNodeId\": \"menu\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"menu\",\n        \"type\": \"option\",\n        \"prompt\": \"1) Nome 2) Atendente\",\n        \"options\": [\n          { \"id\": \"opt-human\", \"label\": \"Atendente\", \"aliases\": [\"2\", \"suporte\"], \"nextNodeId\": \"handoff\" }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"handoff\",\n        \"type\": \"transfer\",\n        \"reason\": \"request_human_support\",\n        \"message\": \"Encaminhando para humano.\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"edges\": []\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/flows/{{flowId}}",
            "description": "Atualiza nome, descrição e/ou definition JSON. Campos opcionais."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /flows/:id/validate",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/flows/{{flowId}}/validate",
            "description": "Valida o grafo do flow sem mudar status."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /flows/:id/publish",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/flows/{{flowId}}/publish",
            "description": "draft → published"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /flows/:id/activate",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/flows/{{flowId}}/activate",
            "description": "published → active (desativa outro active do tenant)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /flows/:id/deactivate",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/flows/{{flowId}}/deactivate",
            "description": "active → published"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /flows/:id/archive",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/flows/{{flowId}}/archive",
            "description": "Arquiva o flow."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /flows/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/flows/{{flowId}}",
            "description": "Remove o flow."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 - Flow Schedules",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /flows/schedules",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('scheduleId', json.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"flowId\": \"{{flowId}}\",\n  \"daysOfWeek\": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5],\n  \"startTime\": \"09:00\",\n  \"endTime\": \"18:00\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/flows/schedules",
            "description": "Cria agendamento. **admin ou manager.**\n\ndaysOfWeek: 0=dom … 6=sáb."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /flows/schedules",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/flows/schedules",
            "description": "Lista agendamentos do tenant."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /flows/schedules/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"startTime\": \"10:00\",\n  \"endTime\": \"17:00\",\n  \"active\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/flows/schedules/{{scheduleId}}",
            "description": "Atualiza agendamento. **admin ou manager.**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /flows/schedules/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/flows/schedules/{{scheduleId}}",
            "description": "Remove agendamento. **admin ou manager.**"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "06 - Conversations",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /conversations",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const first = json.data?.[0];",
                  "  if (first?.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('conversationId', first.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/conversations?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["conversations"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "status", "value": "waiting_human", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista conversas. Query opcional: status (bot|waiting_human|human_active)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /conversations/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}",
            "description": "Detalhe da conversa."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /conversations/:id/access",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/access",
            "description": "URLs embed/deep-link Chatwoot. Requer vínculo Chatwoot na conversa."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "07 - Webhooks (avançado)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /webhook/chatwoot",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-chatwoot-webhook-token", "value": "{{chatwootWebhookToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"message_created\",\n  \"message_type\": \"outgoing\",\n  \"conversation\": { \"id\": 1 },\n  \"content\": \"Mensagem de teste\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/webhook/chatwoot",
            "description": "Webhook Chatwoot. Auth: header x-chatwoot-webhook-token = CHATWOOT_WEBHOOK_TOKEN do .env.\n\nPayload real varia por evento."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /webhook/:tenantId/whatsapp/:instanceId",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{evolutionInstanceApiKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"key\": {\n      \"remoteJid\": \"5511999999999@s.whatsapp.net\",\n      \"id\": \"msg-test-001\"\n    },\n    \"message\": {\n      \"conversation\": \"oi\"\n    },\n    \"messageTimestamp\": 1700000000\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/webhook/{{tenantId}}/whatsapp/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
            "description": "Simula inbound Evolution (MESSAGES_UPSERT). Header apikey = apiKey da instância no JSON do banco.\n\nRequer instância registrada (scripts/local/register-whatsapp-instance.ps1) + flow ativo."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /webhook/:tenantId/whatsapp/:instanceId (Meta verify)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhook/{{tenantId}}/whatsapp/INSTANCE_ID?hub.mode=subscribe&hub.verify_token=TOKEN&hub.challenge=CHALLENGE",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhook", "{{tenantId}}", "whatsapp", "INSTANCE_ID"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "hub.mode", "value": "subscribe" },
                { "key": "hub.verify_token", "value": "TOKEN" },
                { "key": "hub.challenge", "value": "CHALLENGE" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Challenge Meta (somente provider Meta)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
